sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Tool Gateway
  participant P as Policy Engine
  participant B as Credential Broker
  participant A as Tool Adapter
  participant O as Observability
  T->>P: authorize target/action
  P-->>T: allow + credential class
  T->>B: exchange job identity
  B-->>A: short-lived target credential
  A->>A: use in memory
  A-->>T: redacted result
  T->>B: revoke
  B->>O: issuance/revocation metadata
